  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hurricane Season 2024 Post Disaster Assessment and Early Recovery Support to affected countries and technical support CDEMA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This PIP provides a framework for implementation of post-disaster assessment and early recovery support for countries impacted by Hurricanes in 2024, as well as continuing support to CDEMA building on the EnGenDER Project. Expected outputs include disaster assessment reports, support for early recovery planning, early Recovery gender responsive interventions started, and technical support provided to CDEMA. An undeclared TRAC allocation (1.1.3) associated with Hurricane Beryl provides the foundational resources for this PIP, with the framework designed to allow for clear linkage to complementary resources documented separately, as well as additional resources that may be mobilised in the short to medium term.</narrative>
  </description>
